ent-WeaponRifleXlr556 = Falcon
    .desc = A compact assault rifle issued to Nanotrasen response teams. It fires faster than the Lecter and climbs faster too, so short bursts serve it best. Feeds from .20 rifle magazines.
ent-WeaponRifleMR8C = Hawk
    .desc = A semi-automatic marksman rifle with a fixed optic. It is slow to fire and steady at range, and the optic only helps while the rifle is held in both hands. Feeds from .30 rifle magazines.
